WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.550
Check yourself with two questions
from the module's knowledge check.

2
00:00:03.550 --> 00:00:07.950
First: why did adding the alias from
title to job title add a Finding?

3
00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:08.896
The answer is a.

4
00:00:08.896 --> 00:00:11.732
SailPoint's field names
are the connector's,

5
00:00:11.732 --> 00:00:15.987
so without the alias the second
writer of job title was invisible.

6
00:00:15.987 --> 00:00:20.813
The check doesn't guess name pairs;
the alias list is a reviewed input.

7
00:00:20.813 --> 00:00:24.149
Second: Gate 2 offers two writer patterns.

8
00:00:24.149 --> 00:00:25.813
Which choice does it rule out?

9
00:00:25.813 --> 00:00:29.084
The answer is c: both
Entra inbound provisioning

10
00:00:29.084 --> 00:00:32.275
and SailPoint writing
HR-mastered attributes.

11
00:00:32.275 --> 00:00:34.438
In the guide's words, not both.

12
00:00:34.438 --> 00:00:39.410
The module page has two more questions,
each linked to the section that answers it.
